{"id":"matterhorn","name":"Matterhorn","qid":"Q1374","country":"Switzerland; Italy","locality":"Aosta Valley, Canton of Valais","lat":"45.976388888","lon":"7.658611111","built":"","year":null,"year_text":"","century":"","era":"Natural formations","period":"","date_basis":"","style":"","heritage":"","type":"mountain","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Matterhorn","text":"The Matterhorn is a mountain of the Alps, straddling the main watershed and border between Switzerland and Italy. It is a large, near-symmetric pyramidal peak in the extended Monte Rosa area of the Pennine Alps, whose summit is 4,478 metres (14,692 ft) above sea level, making it one of the highest summits in the Alps and Europe. Sometimes referred to as the \"Mountain of Mountains\" (German: Berg der Berge), the Matterhorn has become an indelible emblem of Switzerland and of the Alps as a whole.","text_source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Matterhorn","text_license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","real":[{"id":"gh-f298f4bbbbca","w":900,"h":1200,"title":"Cervino cloud.jpg","o":"gh-f298f4bbbbca.jpg","credit":{"text":"Gianluca Miscione","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cervino_cloud.jpg","via":"Wikimedia Commons"}}],"depictions":[{"id":"civilization-vi--matterhorn","game":"civilization-vi","name":"Matterhorn","verified":false,"text":"","text_source":"","text_license":"","images":[{"id":"gh-p943e1fd56f7","w":1200,"h":675,"o":"gh-p943e1fd56f7.png","credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Civilization VI, © 2K; Aspyr.","source":"https://civilization.fandom.com/wiki/File:Natural_Wonder_Matterhorn_(Civ6).png","via":"Fandom (civilization)","note":"Fandom upload by Xanthos of Thebes on 2020-05-23"}},{"id":"gh-p94928773521","w":186,"h":215,"o":"gh-p94928773521.png","credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Civilization VI, © 2K; Aspyr.","source":"https://civilization.fandom.com/wiki/File:Matterhorn_(Civ6).png","via":"Fandom (civi